<!DOCTYPE HTML5>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>O Furry Friends - Pet Adoption Home</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #fdf6ec;
            color: #4a3c2f;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 40px;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .home-container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: auto;
            background-color: #fff3d8;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            color: #5a3e1b;
            font-size: 36px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #7c5b3e;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        ul {
            margin-top: 10px;
            padding-left: 20px;
        }

        li {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="home-container">
        <h1>Welcome to O Furry Friends</h1>
        <p>Bringing love and joy to every home, one pet at a time.</p>

        <p>At O Furry Friends, we are passionate about helping you find your perfect companion. Whether you're looking to adopt a playful puppy, a curious kitten, or an older furry friend in need of love, we're here to guide you every step of the way.</p>

        <h2>Our Services</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Pet Adoption – Dogs, Cats, and other small animals</li>
            <li>Personalized Pet Matchmaking</li>
            <li>Pet Care Guides and Resources</li>
            <li>Give Away a Pet Responsibly</li>
            <li>Contact Support for Questions or Visits</li>
        </ul>

        <p>Explore our website using the sidebar to learn more about available pets, how to adopt, and how to care for your new best friend. Thank you for supporting pet rescue and adoption!</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>